            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to an electronic module (2) for recording information of a drug delivery device (1), the electronic module (2) comprising at least one connector (7, 7'), wherein at least one connector (7, 7') is adapted to be connected to a port (6) of the drug delivery device (1) and wherein at least one connector (7, 7') is adapted to be connected to a port of a computer. Furthermore, the invention relates to a drug delivery device (1), comprising a port (6) for connecting to the connector (7) of the electronic module (2).</p>
            </abstract>
